                "svg": "<svg width=\"712\" height=\"21\"><text font-family=\"Noto Sans\" font-size=\"9.0\" fill=\"#5b6770\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">GNS3 never starts them, so the red marks on the links mean stopped in GNS3, not down in the range.</text></svg>",
